follow\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"14\"></line><line x1=\"23\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"11\"></line></svg><svg version=\"1.1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_user_check on_unfollow\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><polyline points=\"17 11 19 13 23 9\"></polyline></svg><span class=\"on_follow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Follow gennai</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Follow</span></span><span class=\"on_unfollow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Following gennai</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Following</span></span></a></li><li><a data-game_id=\"5111216\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=add_to_collection&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgennai.itch.io%2Fweather-vfx-godot-4\" class=\"action_btn add_to_collection_btn\"><svg version=\"1.1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_collection_add2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M 1,6 H 14\" /><path d=\"M 1,11 H 14\" /><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://gennai.itch.io/weather-vfx-godot-4#comments\"><svg version=\"1.1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/5111216/weather-vfx-godot-4\" target=\"_blank\" data-label=\"related_btn\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg version=\"1.1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" aria-hidden><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div id=\"header\" class=\"header\"><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Weather VFX for Godot 4 - Rain, Snow, Fog, Wind &amp; Storms</h1></div><div itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Product\" itemscope id=\"view_html_game_2163904\" class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top ready\"><div id=\"html_embed_7222835\" class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\"><div data-height=\"540\" data-width=\"960\" class=\"game_frame game_pending\" style=\"width: 960px; height: 540px\"><button title=\"Enter fullscreen\" class=\"fullscreen_btn\"><img src=\"https://itch.io/static/images/enlarge.svg?1791312061\"/></button><div data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/19598643-2076121/index.html?v=1791297130&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\" class=\"iframe_placeholder\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg version=\"1.1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"24\" aria-hidden><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run asset pack</button></div></div></div><div class=\"donate\"><a data-donate=\"false\" class=\"button donate_btn\" href=\"https://gennai.itch.io/weather-vfx-godot-4/purchase\">Download Now</a></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>Rain, snow, fog, wind, sandstorms, cloud shadows and storm lightning for Godot 4. <strong>3D first, plus a 2D set</strong> for side-scrollers and top-down games. Drop a preset into your scene, or blend between whole weather states with one line of code.</p>\r\n<p>Click <strong>Run asset pack</strong> above to try every effect in your browser before you buy (arrow keys to switch, W for the weather playground, D for the 2D effects). The first load can take about 20 seconds while the shaders compile.</p>\r\n<p><strong>What&#x27;s inside</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>3D rain</strong>: drizzle to downpour with one slider, wind slant, a distant rain layer for depth, ripples and splash crowns on the ground</li>\r\n<li><strong>3D snow</strong>: soft drifting flakes, wind-driven blizzard streaks, sleet and ash</li>\r\n<li><strong>3D fog</strong>: ground fog that creeps along the floor, drifting fog banks, environment height fog. Visible on Compatibility too</li>\r\n<li><strong>3D wind</strong>: wind lines that draw themselves and curl, tumbling leaves or cherry petals, dust motes, gusts shared with your own shaders (the demo grass bends with it)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sandstorm</strong>: streaking grains, rolling dust clouds, ground dust, tinted haze</li>\r\n<li><strong>Cloud shadows</strong> drifting across the scene</li>\r\n<li><strong>Storm lightning</strong>: sky, sun and ambient flicker, clouds glowing from inside, a signal for thunder sounds</li>\r\n<li><strong>Lens raindrops</strong>: beads and sliding drops that bend the image</li>\r\n<li><strong>Shelters</strong>: no rain under roofs, in tunnels or indoors</li>\r\n<li><strong>Weather controller</strong>: <code>weather.transition_to(thunderstorm, 10.0)</code> blends rain, wind, fog, darkness and lightning smoothly. 12 weather profiles included</li>\r\n<li><strong>2D</strong>: rain, snow, fog and wind for side view and top-down, with parallax and a pixel-art mode</li>\r\n<li><strong>32 presets</strong>, a 3D showcase, a 2D showcase, a weather playground and a benchmark scene</li>\r\n<li>English documentation for every node, property and function</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Compatibility</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Godot 4.4 or newer. Tested on 4.4.1 and 4.7.2</li>\r\n<li>Forward+, Mobile and Compatibility renderers, so it also works in Web exports</li>\r\n<li>Tested with zero errors and zero warnings on every combination above</li>\r\n<li>On Compatibility (and Web) the fog has no soft edges where it meets objects, and cloud shadows fall on flat ground only.</li>\r\n<li>No textures, no compute shaders, no volumetric fog required. Every particle is placed by the vertex shader from a static mesh, so the CPU cost stays flat no matter how heavy the rain</li>\r\n<li>Quality setting (LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH) and measured frame times in the docs</li>\r\n<li>Every node is a <code>@tool</code> script and previews around the editor camera</li>\r\n<li>Unique class names (<code>Nimblux*</code>, the pack&#x27;s internal name) and folder (<code>addons/nimblux_fx</code>), so it won&#x27;t clash with other packs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>License</strong></p>\r\n<p>Use it in commercial and non-commercial projects, royalty-free, no credit required. Don&#x27;t resell or redistribute the pack itself. Full text is in LICENSE.txt.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Free version</strong></p>\r\n<p>Want to try it in your own project first? <a href=\"https://gennai.itch.io/free-rain-vfx-godot-4\">Free Rain VFX for Godot 4</a> is free: the same 3D rain with ripples and splashes, one preset and a demo scene. Copy this pack&#x27;s <code>addons/nimblux_fx</code> over it later and your scenes keep working.</p>\r\n<p><strong>About AI</strong></p>\r\n<p>The code was written with the help of an AI coding assistant, then reviewed and tested on every Godot version and renderer listed above. No AI-generated images or sounds are used. Apart from a few small SVG node icons, the pack has no image files.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Updates</strong></p>\r\n<p>Bug reports and requests are welcome in the comments. Updates are free for everyone who bought the pack.</p>\r\n<p>Pairs with <a href=\"https://gennai.itch.io/arcflux-lightning-beam-vfx\">ARCFLUX</a>, our lightning VFX pack: put its sky strike in the storm flash node and your thunderstorm throws real lightning bolts at the ground (optional, this pack does not need it).</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg role=\"img\" height=\"6\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" width=\"12\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div clas